ath/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li>Dao động tổng hợp trên có biên độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> cm và pha ban đầu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
